# v04.0: Search the task list

Issue: #45

Clients filter the whole list on their side because the route takes no query.

## Outcomes

- [ ] Outcome: a list request accepts a title query and returns only matches

## Findings

- Waiting on pagination. A search over an unbounded list returns an unbounded
  response, so this cannot start until `listTasks` takes a limit and an offset.

> Test strategy: unit, search a three-task list and assert one match comes back.
